        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "11.4(d) Overtime. The provisions of 11.8 do not apply to part-time employees. Employees will be paid overtime for hours in excess of forty (40) compensated hours in a work week. All overtime, except on holidays, will be paid at time and one-half. Hours worked on a holiday will be paid per the provisions of Article 7.",
            "block_bbox": [
