        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "11.4(e) Jury Duty and Witness Service, Employees are eligible for jury duty and witness service pay if they are scheduled to work twenty (20) or more hours in a seven (7)-day cycle or forty (40) or more hours in a fourteen (14)-day cycle. Payment will be four (4) hours for each day served, regardless of calendar day or hours scheduled.",
